::: {.notes}

- Multiple possible effect metrics: log odds ratio, log risk ratio, complementary log risk ratio, risk difference

- Alternative models: bivariate meta-analysis [@VanHouwelingen2002advanced], bivariate logistic or hypergeometric GLMM [@Stijnen2010random], baseline risk regression [@Arends2000baseline; @Schmid1998empirical; @Guolo2022measurement], etc.

:::

