## Auxiliary modeling

- Possible auxiliary models for $\hat\pi_{0i}$ or $\hat\pi_{1i}$:

    - Random effects meta-analysis/meta-regression of log-odds

    - Generalized linear mixed model (Normal-binomial)

    - Beta-binomial regression

