:::: {.column width="50%"}

- Hannum and colleagues [@Hannum2020objective] compiled data on rates of olfactory loss across 35 studies of COVID-19 patients.

- Sample sizes ranging from $N_i$ = 15 to 7178 (median = 95, IQR = 56.5 - 267.5).

::::

